Output demos/catalog/catalog.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1500
Set Height 940
Set FontSize 18
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set CursorBlink false
Set Padding 16

Hide
Type `"$NEWTUI_CATALOG_BIN" --item sparkline --width 72 --animate --theme dark`
Enter
Wait+Screen /LIVE CATALOG/
Sleep 500ms
Show
Sleep 8s
Type " r......"
Sleep 1s
Screenshot docs/widgets/generated/catalog.png
Sleep 1s
Down
Type " "
Sleep 6s
Type " r......"
Sleep 1s
Screenshot docs/widgets/generated/butterfly.png
Sleep 1s
Down 2
Type " "
Sleep 4s
Type " r...."
Sleep 1s
Screenshot docs/widgets/generated/heat-meter.png
Sleep 1s
Down
Type " "
Sleep 4s
Type " r........"
Sleep 1s
Screenshot docs/widgets/generated/gauge.png
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
Sleep 200ms
